# Validators whose signed evidence this repository trusts.
# One line per key, in ssh-keygen ALLOWED SIGNERS format:
#   <principal> <key-type> <public-key>
# Example (do not uncomment; generate your own with ssh-keygen -t ed25519):
#   ci@github-actions ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAA...
#
# Adding or removing a line changes who can produce valid evidence, so
# review changes to this file like changes to access control.
